-dtt-completeness</a> 的全部假设；特别是端点已良型且演算是有限强一阶片段。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 与有效性也取该条目的精确模型接口。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A=B:\\mathsf{Ty}&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall M)\\bigl(\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma(M)\\Longrightarrow M\\models(\\Gamma\\vdash A=B:\\mathsf{Ty})\\bigr),\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma a=b:A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall M)\\bigl(\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma(M)\\Longrightarrow M\\models(\\Gamma\\vdash a=b:A)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A=B:\\mathsf{Ty}&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall M)\\bigl(\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma(M)\\Longrightarrow M\\models(\\Gamma\\vdash A=B:\\mathsf{Ty})\\bigr),\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma a=b:A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall M)\\bigl(\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma(M)\\Longrightarrow M\\models(\\Gamma\\vdash a=b:A)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>规范证明与范围修正见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"78b06d051d0fb2fc\" href=\"?note=78b06d051d0fb2fc\" title=\"16-thm-dtt-completeness\">16-thm-dtt-completeness</a>。任意原始判断、弱相等或高阶扩展没有包含在本定理中。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-thm-dtt-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"78b06d051d0fb2fc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-thm-dtt-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-dtt-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"78b06d051d0fb2fc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]"